\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces From observations to recall. The upper route is the exact finite construction: admit located observations, retain their joint law, evaluate field tests and revise affected dependencies. The lower route is the implemented text-delivery study: compile explicit source conditions, rank original passages and supply bounded context to a fixed reader. Their common interface is identified source support. Neither the continuous-law extension nor the finite incremental engine is asserted to produce the text answers.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dm-pipeline}{{1}{3}{From observations to recall. The upper route is the exact finite construction: admit located observations, retain their joint law, evaluate field tests and revise affected dependencies. The lower route is the implemented text-delivery study: compile explicit source conditions, rank original passages and supply bounded context to a fixed reader. Their common interface is identified source support. Neither the continuous-law extension nor the finite incremental engine is asserted to produce the text answers}{figure.1}{}}
