\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Matched-news figure, showing the \emph  {answer-form rules} condition. It is not the requirement-table row in the main paper. The evidence allowance, labelled windows and local summary adaptation are held fixed within this condition. ``RAPTOR''\ in this saved figure denotes the adapted local recursive-summary comparator, not a fresh public-system reproduction. The tie between facet-conditioned and diversity-ranked retrieval is important to the interpretation of the main result.}}{18}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
